INSERT INTO modules (id,course_id,title,weight,sort) VALUES ('nism-5a-m15','nism-5a','Appendices: AMFI codes & resources',NULL,15) ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET course_id=excluded.course_id,title=excluded.title,weight=excluded.weight,sort=excluded.sort;
INSERT INTO lessons (id,course_id,module_id,title,kind,body,minutes,published,sort) VALUES ('nism-5a-l67','nism-5a','nism-5a-m15','Appendix notes 1/2: Appendix 1: SEBI Code of Conduct (Fourth Schedule)','note','## Appendix 1: SEBI Code of Conduct (Fourth Schedule)

- **Trustees & AMC:** high integrity and fairness in all dealings
- Schemes not run in interest of sponsors, AMC/trustee directors or associates
- Equitable, fair treatment of all classes of unitholders
- Adequate, accurate, timely information in simple language
- Avoid excessive concentration with brokers/associates and of units among few investors; avoid conflicts of interest
- Each scheme''s assets, liabilities, bank & securities accounts ring-fenced
- Invest per stated objectives, solely in unitholders'' interest; no unethical selling
- High service standards, due diligence, independent judgment; no exaggerated claims
- Advice in public media only with disclosure of own (and family/employer) positions
- Regulated entities & agents (incl. MFDs) must show registered name & number on social media home page and at start of each video/content

## Appendix 2: AMFI Code of Ethics (1/2)

- **Integrity:** fair dealings; schemes not run for sponsors, directors, trustees, brokers, associates or a special class of unitholders
- **Due diligence:** high service standards, independent judgment, adequate resources
- Disclosures:
  - Timely, simple information on objectives, policies, financials
  - Annual disclosure of investment pattern, portfolio, expense ratios, portfolio turnover
  - Deals with associates/significant unitholders (≥ 5% of corpus) – justify to trustees; disclose in annual & half-yearly reports
  - Key investment personnel''s trades reported to compliance officer at least half-yearly
- **Professional selling:** no unethical means or exaggerated performance claims; disclose risks; provide literature; fair allotment & prompt refunds; handle complaints
  - Don''t present scheme as a share issue, create unrealistic expectations, guarantee returns (unless in SID), offer extraneous benefits or misrepresent

## Appendix 2: AMFI Code of Ethics (2/2)

- **Investment practices:** follow SID objectives; no trades with own directors/officers/employees or trustees
- Operations – prohibited:
  - Front running (trading ahead of fund using non-public information)
  - Self-dealing (benefiting at the fund''s expense)
  - Fraudulent, deceptive or manipulative practices; false markets, price rigging, passing price-sensitive information
  - Staff acting as agents for own schemes (except as employees)
  - Changing fundamental attributes without unitholder approval (unless due to regulation)
- **Reporting:** standard valuation; total-return performance reporting; scheme-wise segregation of cash & securities
- No unfair competition; observe letter and spirit of law
- **Enforcement:** make Code a condition of employment; signed acknowledgement; compliance officer; half-yearly & annual reports to trustees; keep records ≥ 3 years',9,1,67) ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET course_id=excluded.course_id,module_id=excluded.module_id,title=excluded.title,kind=excluded.kind,body=excluded.body,minutes=excluded.minutes,published=excluded.published,sort=excluded.sort;
INSERT INTO lessons (id,course_id,module_id,title,kind,body,minutes,published,sort) VALUES ('nism-5a-l68','nism-5a','nism-5a-m15','Appendix notes 2/2: Appendix 3: AMFI Code for Distributors (1/2)','note','## Appendix 3: AMFI Code for Distributors (1/2)

- Applies to all ARN holders and their directors, partners, sub-distributors, employees, representatives
- Fiduciary duty:
  - Investor''s interest paramount; due diligence; independent judgment
  - Avoid/disclose conflicts – including group/associate products
  - Incentives must not drive recommendations; no aggressive sales culture
  - No rebating of commission, gifts or vouchers
  - No churning, split applications, payment defaults, false payout claims, mis-selling
- **Compliance:** follow SEBI MF Regulations & AMFI circulars; segregate advisory & distribution; KYD; diligent IPV & document attestation
- Know SID/SAI/KIM; explain features & risks; gather client financial status, experience, objectives for suitability
- Qualified representatives; confidentiality – no sharing without consent, no cross-marketing to group companies; follow data protection rules
- Only engage sub-distributors with valid ARN

## Appendix 3: AMFI Code for Distributors (2/2)

- **Infrastructure:** physical & digital (cyber security); internal controls to prevent mis-selling & fraud; insurance encouraged; keep client records incl. suitability consent/dissent
- Client obligations:
  - Provide full scheme information; highlight risks; urge reading SID/SAI/KIM
  - Disclose commissions on competing schemes & list of affiliated MFs; disclose association with AMC
  - MFDs cannot deal in Direct Plans; platforms must state ''Regular Plan'' + commission & document links
  - No indicative portfolio, yield or assured returns
  - Fill forms with investor''s own details only; no tampering; quote EUIN
  - Help resolve grievances; use only AMC-approved material; fair comparisons; explain risks incl. suspension, segregation, winding up
- **Other:** NISM certification, ARN & EUIN renewed on time; staff training incl. responsible social media; cooperate with AMCs/AMFI/SEBI; report changes & misconduct; refund clawed-back commissions
- Cannot use "Adviser", "Wealth Manager", "Consultant" etc. unless SEBI-registered RIA
- Tagline "AMFI-registered Mutual Fund Distributor" (min font 12 in print) on all communication
- **Industry integrity:** no unfair practices; no false or defamatory statements or rumours about AMCs, AMFI, schemes or other MFDs

## Appendix 4: Knowledge Resources

- **SEBI:** SID format circular (Nov 2023) & Master Circular for Mutual Funds (Mar 2026); SAI & KIM formats (Master Circular Jun 2024)
- **SEBI website:** draft NFOs; filed SIDs, KIMs and SAIs of all mutual funds
- **AMFI:** KYC information & forms (amfiindia.com/kyc)
- **AMFI:** Indian & global industry data analysis; monthly data & flows; scheme performance details
- AMFI investor education corner (amfiindia.com/investor)
- **ICI (ici.org/statistics):** worldwide & US mutual fund trends',9,1,68) ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET course_id=excluded.course_id,module_id=excluded.module_id,title=excluded.title,kind=excluded.kind,body=excluded.body,minutes=excluded.minutes,published=excluded.published,sort=excluded.sort;
